--- !u!114 &13155911
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 13155909}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5f7201a12d95ffc409449d95f23cf332, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 0.19607843, g: 0.19607843, b: 0.19607843, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_FontData:
    m_Font: {fileID: 12800000, guid: 5e66e77026a31924e936fc62ef1e97b9, type: 3}
    m_FontSize: 35
    m_FontStyle: 1
    m_BestFit: 0
    m_MinSize: 0
    m_MaxSize: 50
    m_Alignment: 0
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1.2
  m_Text: "March 12, 2025  \n\nI don\u2019t know if I\u2019m imagining things\u2026
    but I swear someone is watching me.  \n\nIt started a few nights ago\u2014just
    a feeling at first. That prickling sensation on the back of my neck, the kind
    you get when you\u2019re not alone. I brushed it off. Maybe I was just being
    paranoid.  \n\nBut last night, I heard footsteps. Slow. Measured. Keeping pace
    with mine no matter how much I tried to convince myself it was nothing. I turned
    around\u2014no one. The street was empty.  \n\nI\u2019m scared to walk home alone
    now. I keep telling myself it\u2019s all in my head, but what if it isn\u2019t? 
    - Rebecca\n"
