    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1.2
  m_Text: "Detective Reagan,\r\n\r\nYou\u2019re always one step behind, chasing shadows,
    grasping at whispers. But tell me\u2014what happens when the hunter becomes the
    hunted?\r\n\r\nI\u2019ve left you a trail, a puzzle only you can solve. Follow
    it, if you dare. But be warned\u2014this game ends soon, and not everyone makes
    it to the final act.\r\n\r\nTick-tock, Detective. Time is running out.\r \u2014The
    Phantom"
