  m_Text: "You saw too much, Rebecca. You should have stayed quiet, but now it\u2019s
    too late. I don\u2019t forgive. I don\u2019t forget. The clock is ticking, and
    soon, you\u2019ll understand what it means to be truly afraid. \u2013 The Phantom"
